Ava6 is an independent experimental fork of cvc5, reduced to a fixed SMT core
for experiments in solving, proofs, parsing, and APIs. See README.md for the
import revision and DESIGN.md for the scope of this fork. Ava6-specific changes
and their contributors are recorded in this repository's Git history.

Upstream cvc5 attribution
========================

The following list is preserved from the cvc5 checkout used for the initial
import. It credits the authors, designers, and main contributors to the
inherited code. The affiliations and Current/Alumni categories describe that
upstream snapshot.

cvc5's copyright is held by these individuals and the affiliated
institutions at the time of their contributions (note that some authors have
had more than one affiliated institution).  See the file COPYING for details on
the copyright and licensing of cvc5.

The developers and authors of cvc5 are:

