Upstream cvc5 also credits other contributors in its THANKS file, which was
not included in this source import.

cvc5 is the fifth in the CVC series of tools (CVC, CVC Lite, CVC3, CVC4) but
does not directly incorporate code from any previous version prior to CVC4.
Information about authors of previous CVC tools is included with their
distributions.

Ava6 retains the MiniSAT code included in cvc5, by Niklas Een and Niklas Sorensson.
